msgstr "Item"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_operations.field_bf_property_maintenance_plan__instruction_text
msgid ""
"Ce qu'il y a à faire, dans le détail, recopié sur chaque travail ouvert. Une"
" consigne qui vit uniquement dans la tête du concierge sortant se perd avec "
"lui."
msgstr ""
"What there is to do, in detail, copied onto each work opened. An instruction"
" that lives only in the outgoing caretaker's head is lost with them."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_operations.view_maintenance_plan_form
msgid "Ce qu'il y a à faire, pas à pas. Recopié sur chaque travail ouvert."
msgstr "What there is to do, step by step. Copied onto each work opened."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_operations.view_shift_form
msgid "Ce quart reprend la passation de"
msgstr "This shift takes over the handover from"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_operations.field_bf_property_shift_line__state
msgid ""
"Ce que CE quart a fait du travail, pas l'état du travail lui-même, qui vit "
"sur le billet."
msgstr ""
"What THIS shift did with the work, not the state of the work itself, which "
"lives on the ticket."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_operations.field_bf_property_shift__handover_note
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_operations.view_shift_form
msgid ""
"Ce que le quart suivant doit savoir et que les enregistrements ne disent pas"
" : le local qu'on n'a pas pu ouvrir, le locataire à rappeler, la pièce "
"commandée qui arrive demain."
msgstr ""
"What the next shift must know and that the records do not say: the room that"
" could not be opened, the lessee to call back, the part ordered that arrives"
" tomorrow."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_operations.field_bf_property_shift_close_wizard__handover_note
msgid ""
"Ce que le quart suivant doit savoir et que les enregistrements ne disent "
"pas."
msgstr "What the next shift must know and that the records do not say."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_operations.field_maintenance_equipment__bf_location_display
msgid ""
"Ce que le rattachement au bâti donne à lire, sans remplacer le texte libre "
"d'origine : les deux coexistent, parce qu'une précision comme « sous-sol, "
"local 3 » n'a pas de champ."
msgstr ""
"What the attachment to the building gives to read, without replacing the "
"original free text: the two coexist, because a detail such as \"basement, "
"room 3\" has no field."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_operations.field_bf_property_maintenance_plan__name
msgid ""
"Ce qui est à faire, dit comme on le dirait à la personne qui le fera : « "
"Inspection de la chaudière », « Vérification des détecteurs de fumée »."
msgstr ""
"What is to be done, said as one would say it to the person who will do it: "
"\"Boiler inspection\", \"Smoke detector check\"."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_operations.field_bf_property_shift__handover_note
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_operations.field_bf_property_shift_close_wizard__handover_note
msgid "Ce qui passe au quart suivant"
msgstr "What passes to the next shift"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:bf_property_operations.action_operations_equipment_analysis
