msgstr ""
"An archived schedule stops opening works. The works already opened remain."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:bf_property_operations.action_maintenance_plan
msgid ""
"Un cédule fait naître le travail du bien et de sa fréquence.\n"
"                La chaudière s'inspecte deux fois l'an, que le billet\n"
"                précédent ait été fermé ou non."
msgstr ""
"A schedule gives rise to the work from the item and its frequency.\n"
"                The boiler is inspected twice a year, whether the previous\n"
"                ticket was closed or not."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_operations/models/bf_property_shift.py:0
msgid "Un quart ne se passe pas la main à lui-même."
msgstr "A shift does not hand over to itself."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:bf_property_operations.action_shift
msgid ""
"Un quart porte une plage, une équipe, des personnes et sa liste\n"
"                de travail. Il se ferme en passant la main : le travail resté\n"
"                ouvert va à un quart nommé, avec un mot sur ce que la liste ne\n"
"                dit pas. C'est cette passation qui distingue un quart d'un\n"
"                tableau de tâches."
msgstr ""
"A shift carries a period, a team, persons and its work\n"
"                list. It closes by handing over: the work left open\n"
"                goes to a named shift, with a word on what the list does not\n"
"                say. It is this handover that distinguishes a shift from a\n"
"                task board."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:bf_property_operations.constraint_bf_property_shift_shift_dates
msgid "Un quart se termine après avoir commencé."
msgstr "A shift ends after it began."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_operations.field_bf_property_shift_line__drop_reason
msgid ""
"Un travail qu'on sort de la liste du quart sort pour une raison. Elle ne "
"remplace pas celle de l'art. 4 : celle-là dit pourquoi un entretien n'a pas "
"été FAIT, celle-ci pourquoi il n'était pas à faire pendant ce quart-ci."
msgstr ""
"A work taken off the shift list is taken off for a reason. It does not "
"replace the one under section 4: that one says why a maintenance was not "
"DONE, this one why it was not to be done during this particular shift."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:bf_property_operations.constraint_bf_property_maintenance_plan_interval_positive
msgid "Une fréquence d'entretien se répète au moins tous les 1."
msgstr "A maintenance frequency repeats at least every 1."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_operations.field_bf_property_maintenance_plan__interval_unit
msgid "Unité"
msgstr "Unit"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_operations.view_shift_form
msgid "Vide = tout le secteur de l'équipe"
msgstr "Empty = the team's whole sector"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_operations.view_shift_form
msgid "le"
msgstr "on"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_operations.view_maintenance_plan_form
msgid "p. ex. Inspection de la chaudière"
msgstr "e.g. Boiler inspection"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_operations.view_maintenance_request_form_property_plan
msgid "p. ex. accès au local mécanique refusé par le locataire"
msgstr "e.g. access to the mechanical room refused by the lessee"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_operations.view_shift_form
msgid "par"
msgstr "by"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_operations.field_maintenance_request__bf_repair_scope
msgid ""
"r. 8.01 : une réparation courante se note à l'art. 2 al. 2, par. 3° ; une "
"réparation majeure ou un remplacement se notent à l'art. 3 al. 2, avec leur "
"coût. « Correctif » ne dit ni l'un ni l'autre. Laissé vide, rien ne remonte "
"au carnet : le module ne qualifie pas une réparation à la place de la "
"personne qui la constate."
msgstr ""
"r. 8.01: an ordinary repair is noted at s. 2 para. 2, subpara. 3; a major "
"repair or a replacement are noted at s. 3 para. 2, with their cost. "
"\"Corrective\" says neither one nor the other. Left empty, nothing goes up "
"to the log: the module does not characterise a repair in place of the person"
" who observes it."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_operations.field_bf_property_maintenance_plan__interval_count
msgid ""
"r. 8.01, art. 2 al. 2, par. 2° : la fréquence à laquelle les travaux "
"d'entretien requis doivent être effectués."
msgstr ""
"r. 8.01, s. 2 para. 2, subpara. 2: the frequency at which the required "
"maintenance work must be carried out."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_operations.field_bf_property_shift_line__work_not_done_reason
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_operations.field_maintenance_request__bf_not_done_reason
msgid ""
"r. 8.01, art. 4 : lors de la mise à jour annuelle, le carnet mentionne les "
"travaux requis ou prévus qui n'ont pas été effectués ET indique pourquoi. La"
" raison vient de la personne qui constate, jamais d'un calcul."
msgstr ""
"r. 8.01, s. 4: at the annual update, the log mentions the required or "
"planned works that were not carried out AND states why. The reason comes "
"from the person who observes, never from a calculation."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_operations.view_shift_form
msgid "si retiré de la liste"
msgstr "if removed from the list"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_operations/models/bf_property_shift.py:0
msgid "tout le secteur"
msgstr "the whole sector"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_operations.view_shift_close_wizard_form
msgid ""
"travaux ne sont pas réglés. Nommez le quart qui les reprend,\n"
"                    et dites ce que la liste ne dit pas : c'est cette passation\n"
"                    qui distingue un quart d'un tableau de tâches."
msgstr ""
"works are not settled. Name the shift taking them over,\n"
"                    and say what the list does not say: it is this handover\n"
"                    that distinguishes a shift from a task board."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_operations/models/maintenance_equipment.py:0
msgid ""
"« %(equipment)s » appartient à %(company)s et l'immeuble %(building)s à "
"%(other)s."
msgstr ""
"\"%(equipment)s\" belongs to %(company)s and the immovable %(building)s to "
"%(other)s."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_operations/models/maintenance_equipment.py:0
msgid ""
"« %(equipment)s » est rattaché à l'immeuble %(building)s, mais l'emplacement"
" choisi appartient à %(anchor)s."
msgstr ""
"\"%(equipment)s\" is attached to the immovable %(building)s, but the "
"location chosen belongs to %(anchor)s."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_operations/models/maintenance_equipment.py:0
msgid ""
"« %(equipment)s » est rattaché à la fois à la fraction %(unit)s et à la "
"partie commune %(area)s. Un équipement est dans l'une ou dans l'autre : "
"c'est ce partage qui dit qui en répond."
msgstr ""
"\"%(equipment)s\" is attached both to fraction %(unit)s and to the common "
"portion %(area)s. Equipment is in one or the other: it is that division that"
" says who answers for it."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_operations/models/maintenance_equipment.py:0
msgid ""
"« %(equipment)s » n'est rattaché à aucun immeuble, alors que l'emplacement "
"choisi appartient à %(anchor)s."
msgstr ""
"\"%(equipment)s\" is attached to no immovable, while the location chosen "
"belongs to %(anchor)s."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_operations/models/bf_property_shift.py:0
msgid ""
"« %(next)s » est tenu par %(team)s, qui ne répond pas de %(buildings)s. Un "
"travail qui change d'équipe change de secteur : rattachez l'immeuble à cette"
" équipe, ou passez la main à un quart de %(own)s."
msgstr ""
"\"%(next)s\" is held by %(team)s, which does not answer for %(buildings)s. A"
" work that changes team changes sector: attach the immovable to this team, "
"or hand over to a shift of %(own)s."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_operations/models/bf_property_shift.py:0
msgid ""
"« %(shift)s » passe %(count)s travaux au quart suivant sans un mot. Ce qui "
"se transmet d'un quart à l'autre n'est pas la liste (elle se lit), c'est ce "
"que la liste ne dit pas."
msgstr ""
"\"%(shift)s\" passes %(count)s works to the next shift without a word. What "
"is handed from one shift to the next is not the list (it can be read), it is"
" what the list does not say."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_operations/models/maintenance_request.py:0
msgid ""
"« %(work)s » vient du cédule « %(plan)s » et porte en plus la répétition du "
"billet. À sa fermeture, les deux ouvriraient chacun le suivant. La fréquence"
" se règle sur le cédule."
msgstr ""
"\"%(work)s\" comes from the schedule \"%(plan)s\" and additionally carries "
"the ticket's own repetition. On closing, the two would each open the next "
"one. The frequency is set on the schedule."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_operations/models/bf_property_shift.py:0
msgid ""
"« %s » sort de la liste du quart sans raison. Un travail retiré sans motif "
"se relit comme un travail oublié."
msgstr ""
"\"%s\" comes off the shift list without a reason. A work removed without a "
"ground reads back as a work forgotten."

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_property_operations.selection__bf_property_shift_line__state__todo
msgid "À faire"
msgstr "To do"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_operations.field_bf_property_maintenance_plan__start_date
msgid "À partir du"
msgstr "From"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_operations.view_maintenance_plan_search
msgid "À échoir"
msgstr "Falling due"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_operations.view_maintenance_plan_search_overdue
msgid "Échu"
msgstr "Lapsed"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_operations.field_bf_property_shift__maintenance_team_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_operations.field_bf_property_shift_close_wizard__maintenance_team_id
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_operations.view_maintenance_request_search_analysis
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_operations.view_shift_search
msgid "Équipe"
msgstr "Team"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_operations.field_bf_property_building__bf_maintenance_team_id
msgid "Équipe d'entretien"
msgstr "Maintenance team"

#. module: bf_property_operations
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_operations.field_bf_property_shift__state
